.\" Manpage for Vltimate CV Scraper
.TH VLTIMATE-CV-SCRAPER 1 "12 August 2026" "v2.2" "Vltimate CV Scraper Manual"
.SH NAME
vltimate-cv-scraper \- Technical Intelligence Harvester, Interactive Revision Loop & ATS Resume Engine
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B harvest_cv.sh
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B Vltimate CV Scraper
is an automated, privacy-conscious technical intelligence harvester and ATS resume engine. It scans local system architecture, shell command history, git configurations, and remote GitHub repositories to build an unformatted master knowledge base (\fBoutput/raw_technical_profile.md\fR), a unified interactive bilingual HTML resume (\fBoutput/cv.html\fR), and headless PDF exports (\fBoutput/cv_en.pdf\fR and \fBoutput/cv_pl.pdf\fR).

It includes an interactive revision loop (\fB\-i, \-\-interactive\fR) allowing users to resolve data conflicts, request section edits, add custom pointers, or refine text live via \fBagy\fR prompting before finalizing PDF rendering and encryption.

.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Display command usage and options summary.
.TP
.BR \-i ", " \-\-interactive
Enable interactive prompt edit, conflict resolution, and revision loop via \fBagy\fR.
.TP
.BR \-t ", " \-\-tailor " \fI<FILE_OR_URL>\fR"
Tailor resume summary, keyword badges, and experience bullet points specifically to a job description text file or web URL.
.TP
.BR \-p ", " \-\-pdf
Force immediate headless PDF compilation using Google Chrome.
.TP
.BR \-d ", " \-\-diff
Generate a visual experience diff log (\fBharvest_diff.log\fR) comparing current harvested data against previous runs.
.TP
.BR \-e ", " \-\-encrypt-mode " \fI<aes|gpg>\fR"
Select encryption engine: \fBaes\fR (OpenSSL AES-256-CBC, default) or \fBgpg\fR (GPG key encryption).
.TP
.BR \-\-gui
Open interactive customization GUI in Google Chrome to set default PDF themes and RODO options.
.TP
.BR \-c ", " \-\-config
Reconfigure persistent GitHub credentials and private cloud sync settings (\fB.vltimate_config.env\fR).

.SH SUBDIRECTORY TREE
.TP
.I input/
Stores baseline technical data rotated from prior runs to build upon.
.TP
.I output/
Stores freshly generated knowledge base and unified bilingual HTML/PDF resumes.
.TP
.I archives/
Stores timestamped compressed snapshots (\fBsnapshot_*.tar.gz\fR) of previous runs.

.SH BUGS
Report bugs to <https://github.com/Vikyek/vltimate-cv-scraper/issues>.
